3/photo/2U/2954/0G10DYDE14C1B118FA6460px.jpg","time":"2025-08-02T23:25:30+08:00","caption":"配搭無得輸但未到驚艷，旁邊乳酪普通啦。不過個沙律先係彩蛋！柚子醬汁🍊好Fresh好清新，食完成個醒神～","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0DiYQ01"},{"full":"https://static6.orstatic.com/userphoto3/photo/2U/2954/0G10DX7A7F303CCBFF2B52px.jpg","time":"2025-08-02T23:25:30+08:00","caption":"忌廉控必試！抹茶味超濃郁，上面嗰層厚實忌廉☁️甜甜哋，同抹茶拿鐵夾到爆！可以攪勻飲，又可以用匙羹逐啖嘆，兩種食法都正。","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0DSYQ01"},{"full":"https://static5.orstatic.com/userphoto3/photo/2U/2954/0G10DW35D34C64416F6A1Fpx.jpg","time":"2025-08-02T23:25:30+08:00","caption":"意粉煮得啱啱好，掛滿香濃蒜油🧄，每一啖都勁惹味，加埋有一塊塊蒜片，大蝦新鮮彈牙🦐，成件事非常夾。唯一小提示：味道偏濃，配杯嘢飲就更加正！","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0DCYQ01"},{"full":"https://static8.orstatic.com/userphoto3/photo/2U/2954/0G10DVB3A516C7A52CD2C6px.jpg","time":"2025-08-02T23:25:30+08:00","caption":"好食到犯規！試過幾間餐廳嘅青醬意粉，呢間可能係全港最強🥇。青醬超濃郁但唔會變『草青味』，混合咗芝士、松子同火箭菜，一啲都唔膩！雞胸仲要嫩到爆，完全唔『鞋』。絕對","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0CyHD01"},{"full":"https://static7.orstatic.com/userphoto3/photo/2S/27IZ/0FPIZ6338DDB03BA960AE6px.jpg","time":"2025-05-14T22:37:17+08:00","caption":"慢煮雞胸炒蛋貝果","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0KfkI01"},{"full":"https://static6.orstatic.com/userphoto3/photo/2S/272O/0FMB0HAD14050FE41C01B3px.jpg","time":"2025-04-20T22:59:24+08:00","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0GL2G01"},{"full":"https://static5.orstatic.com/userphoto3/photo/2S/272O/0FMB0GADD097589E726F38px.jpg","time":"2025-04-20T22:59:24+08:00","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0G52G01"},{"full":"https://static8.orstatic.com/userphoto3/photo/2S/272O/0FMB0F42E1D9B4AC29D43Bpx.jpg","time":"2025-04-20T22:59:24+08:00","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0Fr2G01"},{"full":"https://static7.orstatic.com/userphoto3/photo/2S/272O/0FMB0E85E8800A6B71E44Cpx.jpg","time":"2025-04-20T22:59:24+08:00","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0Fb2G01"},{"full":"https://static6.orstatic.com/userphoto3/photo/2S/272O/0FMB0D7896B7F6490F4D2Cpx.jpg","time":"2025-04-20T22:59:24+08:00","source":"htt